# Normalise every tracked text file to LF in the repository, regardless of
# a contributor's local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true (the default many editors leave in
# place) re-commits CRLF line endings, which Prettier's default
# endOfLine: "lf" then flags — CI's Format check was failing on files no
# one had touched (README.md, packages/shared's whole tree) for exactly
# this reason, independent of any one contributor's actual changes.
* text=auto eol=lf
